  "notes": "Drawn from the left side (2026-05-30, side-on) and Alaska's photo of the right side. The two sides carry different quotes (titles marked by side); the right side's quote is placed from Alaska's three-quarter photo, so its position is less sure. The profiles are drawn as one copper field with an amber front: each face is in the logo entry. The 'UNCF' logo on the engines and the small quote attributions aren't drawn.",
